  "findings": [
    "Exact uniform classical mixture defines rho=I/3 without an infinite-temperature limit. Projective initial/final energy records and isolated ordered pulses uniquely define the observable.",
    "The supplied Hermitian response operator and exact unitary are mathematically valid, with exact first-three cumulants for the uniform mixture; the fourth differs by a positive commutator norm. This is a physical measurement-statistics distinction, not an algebra defect.",
    "Oracle uses joint energy outcomes; reference independently solves Schrodinger dynamics and extracts characteristic-function coefficients. Mean-zero cyclic preparation does not require zero third cumulant because the three-level transition matrix need not be symmetric.",
    "No public correction formula or solver restriction; exact neutral instruction and four-percent private gate preserved."
  ],
